      2. White label assets available to feature for customer
      3. Ability to showcase conceptually how roadmap features could exist in product.
      4. Minimum 24 hours TO 1 week max lead time to live customer demo
   2. First live customer rapid-deployment would be by end of Q4-December 2026.&#x20;
      1. Experience with authentication (user/pass or magic link)
      2. Customer tenant deployed app with white label assets
      3. Product with existing/live features only
      4. Sign-to-online maximum 1 week.
3. Customer data limited to GA features available in CSR Chat&#x20;
   1. Base feature-set of CSR Chat experience
   2. AtlastIQ services populated with minimum required customer non-PHI data&#x20;
   3. All integrations for a pilot customer should be minimized or non-existent via manual delivery of customer data and no external authentication integrations
